ou call this function from the body of an asynchronous function,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the unsafe task handle passed to the closure is always non-"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"because an asynchronous function always runs in the context of a task."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However, if you call this function from the body of a synchronous function,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and that function isn’t executing in the context of any task,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the unsafe task handle is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Storing an unsafe reference to a task doesn’t affect the task’s actual life cycle,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the behavior of accessing an unsafe task reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"outside of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withUnsafeCurrentTask(body:)"},{"type":"text","text":" method’s closure is unsafe and undefined behavior."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"There’s no safe way to retrieve a reference to the current task"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and save it for long-term use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To query the current task without saving a reference to it,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use properties like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"currentPriority"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If you need to store a reference to a task,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"create an unstructured task using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Task.detached(priority:operation:)"},{"type":"text","text":" instead."}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","tex